{"id":"wb-5-259","name":"浑源永安寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永安寺 (浑源)","text":"浑源永安寺，位于山西省浑源县县城东北鼓楼北巷，为中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n浑源永安寺始建于金朝，后毁于战火。元朝初期，永安军节度使高定邀请归云禅师担任主持并重建该寺。元延祐二年（1315年），高璞重新修缮，此后历朝历代均有修缮。该寺以墙壁绘画为著称。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA_(%E6%B5%91%E6%BA%90)","revisionId":86856940,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856940","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7eaa6c9d6a4124633bcb6fb0.jpg","title":"永安寺传法正宗殿正面.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B0%B8%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA%E4%BC%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%97%E6%AE%BF%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/%E6%B0%B8%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA%E4%BC%A0%E6%B3%95%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%97%E6%AE%BF%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Patrick20242023","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"永安寺传法正宗殿正面","width":320,"height":240}}